# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# Production Build Output
dist/

# Operating System Files
.DS_Store
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db

# Logs & Temporary Files
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.env
.env.*
.npmrc

# Privacy: Ignore ALL markdown files across root and all subdirectories by default
*.md
**/*.md

# Whitelist Public GitHub Repository Documentation
!README.md
!ARCHITECTURE.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!docs/
!docs/*.md

# Track durable Serena project memories
!.serena/memories/
!.serena/memories/*.md
